@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 2: OPAL Policy Synchronization and Distribution Workflow

actor "Governance\nAdministrator" as Admin
participant "Git Repository\n(Rego Policies)" as Git
participant "OPAL Server" as OPAL
participant "Policy Bundle\nService" as Bundle
participant "OPA\nPolicy Decision Point" as OPA
participant "Trino\nQuery Engine" as Trino
actor "User" as User

== Policy Authoring ==

Admin -> Git : Commit Updated Rego Policy
activate Git
note right of Git
  Examples:
  • RBAC
  • Column Masking
  • Cross-Domain Restriction
  • Compliance Rules
end note
Git --> Admin : Commit Successful
deactivate Git

== Repository Monitoring ==

loop Continuous Monitoring
    OPAL -> Git : Poll / Webhook Event

    alt New Commit Detected
        Git --> OPAL : Updated Policy Files
        activate OPAL

        note right of OPAL
          Detect:
          • Added Policies
          • Updated Policies
          • Deleted Policies
        end note

        OPAL -> OPAL : Validate Rego Syntax
        OPAL -> OPAL : Validate Bundle Integrity

        alt Validation Successful
            OPAL -> Bundle : Create Policy Bundle
            activate Bundle
            Bundle --> OPAL : Bundle Ready
            deactivate Bundle

            == Policy Distribution ==

            OPAL -> OPA : Push Updated Bundle
            activate OPA
            note right of OPA
              Load New Policies
              Replace Previous Bundle
              Update Decision Cache
            end note
            OPA --> OPAL : Bundle Loaded Successfully
            deactivate OPA

            == Runtime Synchronization ==

            OPAL -> Trino : Notify Policy Refresh
            activate Trino
            note right of Trino
              No Restart Required

              All New Queries
              use Updated Policies
              immediately
            end note
            Trino --> OPAL : Synchronization Complete
            deactivate Trino
        else Validation Failed
            OPAL --> Admin : Validation Error
            note right of OPAL
              Invalid Rego
              or Bundle Structure
            end note
        end
        deactivate OPAL
    else No Policy Changes
        OPAL --> Git : No Updates
    end
end

== Runtime Query Evaluation ==

User -> Trino : Execute SQL Query
activate Trino
Trino -> OPA : Policy Decision Request
activate OPA
note right of OPA
  Latest Policy Version

  is already active

  (No Restart Required)
end note
OPA --> Trino : Allow / Deny Decision
deactivate OPA
Trino --> User : Query Result
deactivate Trino

== Audit Logging ==

OPA -> OPA : Record Policy Version
OPA -> OPA : Record Decision Log
OPA -> OPA : Record Timestamp
OPA -> OPA : Record Compliance Mapping

note right of OPA
  Audit Metadata

  • Policy Version

  • Git Commit ID

  • Timestamp

  • Decision

  • User

  • Resource

  • GDPR

  • BCBS239

  • FCA
end note

@enduml
